  (text "LOW-SIDE ONLY: external loads connect to separately fused +12V; return current through all driver GND/EP pads.\n3V3 MCU high -> inverter low -> load ON, only with hardware EN and SPI OUT_EN. MCU reset -> OFF.\nCandidate envelope for initial calculation: <=1.4A turn-off; repeated clamp energy <=7mJ, NOT an approved rating.\nNo low-impedance peak/hold injector support. VVT/AUX frequencies require scheduled GPIO implementation.\nDriver fault thresholds, load L/R, simultaneous dissipation, harness fuses and board heat sinking remain unqualified."
    (at 25.4 335 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "5559bf1b-6240-5b46-953b-1151f747c06a"))
  (sheet_instances
    (path "/"
      (page "1"))))
